[329.756848, "o", "EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[329.774767, "o", "Number of chapters: 29\r\nNumber of timestamps: 29\r\n\r\nChapter mapping:\r\n1. What we'll do: 0s\r\n2. How we'll get there: 15s\r\n3. Getting a floor plan: 31s\r\n4. Getting started: 37s\r\n5. Basic Navigation: 46s\r\n6. Import your plan into Blender: 57s\r\n7. Basic transform operations: 70s\r\n8. Setting up the plan and units: 83s\r\n9. It all starts with a plane: 92s\r\n10. Scaling the plane to real dimensions: 214s\r\n11. Getting the plan in place: 239s\r\n12. Tracing the outline: 306s\r\n13. Tracing inner walls: 351s\r\n14. Break: 380s\r\n15. Continue tracing inner walls: 389s\r\n16. Remove doubled vertices: 574s\r\n17. Save: 610s\r\n18. Make the floor: 624s\r\n19. Remove unnecessary geometry: 723s"]
[329.774846, "o", "\r\n20. Make the floor's faces: 863s\r\n21. Make the background: 881s\r\n22. Extruding the walls in Z: 911s\r\n23. Reviewing face orientation: 1022s\r\n24. Adding thickness to walls with Modifiers: 1043s\r\n25. Fixing face orientation errors: 1137s\r\n26. Note on face orientation: 1181s\r\n27. Save As: 1255s\r\n28. If you need thick and thin walls: 1319s\r\n29. Great job!: 1368s\r\n"]
